WEBVTT

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:08.780
<i>This girl...</i>

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:12.240
<i>Is she my Pal?</i>

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.550
How dare you stare into the face of a sleeping lady!

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.060
How tacky can you get?!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.150
Y-You're crazy strong!

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.400
Of course I am!

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.560
That's 'cause I'm a dragon.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.650
So you're...

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.570
You're my Pal.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.280
Yup. Got a problem with that?

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.080
Okay, then!

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.910
I'm Ash, and I'll be your master.

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:03.290
Nice to meet you.

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.690
Huh?

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.630
I think you might be a little mixed up.

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:10.130
Remember this.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.630
You're not my master.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.840
I'm <i>your</i> master!

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:21.350
What?

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.370
Between the Zepharos Empire to the north

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.620
and the Chevron Kingdom to the south

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.560
lies Lautreamont Knight Country.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.650
Known as "Dragon-Rearing Land,"

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:37.050
it boasts the largest dragon population on the Arc Strada continent.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:40.700
This small country with fewer than five million citizens

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.630
is home to a unique school:

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.450
Ansullivan Dragonar Academy.

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:48.080
It aims to educate and guide dragon masters

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.230
and the so-called Breeders,
those young men and women

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:54.230
who have entered into bonds with dragons.

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.520
Pretty seedy room.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.560
Seedy? Well, excuse me!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.690
Whatever.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.020
Huh?

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.610
Hey, that's-

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.500
Is there a problem?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.660
Where do you expect me to sleep?

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.820
The floor seems about right for a dog.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:44.720
What?

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.970
C'mon, you can't-

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:53.990
Is she for real?

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.520
H-Hey!

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.160
Are you half-asleep or what?

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.860
Hey, wake up!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.330
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.660
<i>a baby dragon's play-biting that I heard about?</i>

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:34.870
<i>I've really become a Breeder, huh?</i>

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.380
Smells delicious.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.180
Huh?

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.010
Don't tell me you're gonna eat-

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.030
Ow!

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:46.000
Wh-Whoa, stop that!

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.510
Stay away from down there!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.710
Don't bite it!

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.020
Coming.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.690
Hello, Ash Blake!

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:06.960
Oversleeping doesn't make a good impression, even on a day off.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.480
M-Miss President!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:09.950
This is the boys' dorm!

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.950
Think nothing of it. Pardon me.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:15.950
And there's no need to use formal titles with me.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.230
My name will do.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.750
Um... can I help you, Miss Rebecca?

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:25.400
I've come to check up on your Pal.

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:33.270
What a great night's sleep.

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.270
This is highly inappropriate!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:40.520
A-And... what about these?
They sure look like hickeys to me.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.610
It's not what you think.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.890
How can that be?!

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.400
It doesn't look like they slept in the same bed.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.160
Of course we didn't.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.930
And these are a baby dragon's play bites.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.380
Then why is she naked?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.850
That's a no-brainer!

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:58.700
The proud dragon race has no use for clothing.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.570
Look, just put this on, will you?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:01.570
This is how you treat your master?!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.130
I figured as much.
This is how you treat your master?!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:06.620
Just because she's a woman
doesn't mean she'll have clothes.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:10.090
Dress her in these. Just some of my hand-me-downs, I'm afraid.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.100
Thank you!

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:14.850
Now then...

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.540
Regarding her...

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.610
the Academy has decided to ask
Dr. Cornwell to conduct an investigation

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.610
in order to determine
the best way to deal with her.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:29.360
By Dr. Cornwell, you mean...

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.370
The foremost authority on dragon research.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:36.440
Until Dr. Cornwell weighs in,
your Pal will live here.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:37.870
Understood.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:40.370
I'll be sure to take good care of her.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.510
I've spoken with the registrar's office,

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:47.770
so you can bill them for your Pal-raising expenses.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.820
Buy her the things she needs.

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:53.390
That will be a huge help.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.440
Not bad.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:21.050
For something designed by
stupid dum-dum humans, that is.

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.670
That's quite a high horse you're riding.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.160
What should we buy first?

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.170
Oh, what's that?!

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:36.180
Even your stomach rumbles are dragon-class.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:40.690
Wh-What did you expect?
I haven't even had breakfast yet.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.330
This is really delicious!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.190
That does it!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.950
These anthar crepes will be my staple food.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:57.080
It's just a snack. Dragons eat meat, you know.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.450
You'll never get bigger if you only eat crepes.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.320
Did I ask for your opinion?

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:04.960
What's wrong?

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.390
Hey!

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:10.970
My body... has suddenly... become so hot.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.910
C'mon, hang in there. Can you stand up?

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:16.200
Let's get you to a hospital!

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:16.640
No.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.390
Huh?

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.530
I can't...

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:20.470
I...

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.980
I can't take it anymore.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:23.820
Huh?

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:27.980
Please... do something.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:37.720
If this keeps up... who...
who knows what will happen?

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:43.290
Such behavior, and in public?
Have you no sense of decency?!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.800
Y-Your Highness!

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.550
You disappoint me, Ash Blake.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:54.320
Is that any way for an Ansullivan student to present himself?!

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.550
N-No, wait!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.180
Th-This is...

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.150
<i>Str...</i>

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:14.820
<i>String...</i>

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:16.570
<i>bikini?</i>

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.160
No peeking!

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:23.660
I haven't done anything wrong.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:27.700
Seriously. Feeding her crepes containing anthar?

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:33.640
This should wash away the anthar component. She'll be fine.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:36.030
Thanks for that, uh...

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:39.000
Cosette. And you're welcome.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.800
Anthar is like alcohol to us humans.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.720
Giving it to underage dragons is strictly forbidden.

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.270
Didn't you learn <i>anything</i> at the Academy?

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:52.970
Now, now, don't be angry.
Look on the bright side.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:57.240
You were looking for Master Ash,
and now you've found him.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.930
You were looking for me?

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.620
Ash Blake!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.450
There's something I must say to you.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.460
Me?

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:13.340
What I said about your Pal earlier...

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:18.470
I said, your Pal may already be dead.

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:21.220
That...

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:25.640
That was a... a mistake on my part.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.100
I lost my temper, and I just...

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.330
Sorry.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.370
Well then, goodbye!

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:37.560
And there you have it.
Now, if you'll excuse me...

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:43.280
If only she were always that agreeable.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.290
You're not defying your master

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:48.580
and entertaining any special feelings for that female, are you?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:49.750
No!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.080
Stop that!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.000
Quit screwing around!

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:09.200
Is this a present for your little sister?

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:12.570
His sister? Don't be ridiculous! I'm his master!

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:13.480
H-Hey!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:15.980
I'm beat.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:18.600
Did we forget anything?

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.080
Another crepe!

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.990
You don't seriously still want to eat.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:28.860
Stop gazing at me, and go buy me another crepe already!

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:31.500
Look, you were sick until a minute ago.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.290
Well, I feel fine now.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.410
Look.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:36.570
"Look," "Look," he says. Hmph!

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.250
Use my name when you address me.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.250
Your name?

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:42.010
My name...

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:43.950
That's right.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:49.480
I get to name you, don't I?

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.300
If you must.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.650
I've had a name picked out for ages.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.540
You have?

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:04.160
Your name... is Eco.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:06.420
Eco?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:13.100
It's what the first Breeder,
Rosa Maria, named her Pal:

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.940
Eco.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.410
Eco...

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.220
Bond complete.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:48.950
Now my astral flow has joined with yours.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.530
Astral flow, huh?

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.010
It's not half bad!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.090
Eco.

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:58.670
A pretty nice name, coming from you.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.600
Well, I'm glad you like it.

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:36.500
How nice that you were able to speak with Master Ash.

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.840
I was merely adhering to our family motto.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.560
"One must acknowledge one's mistakes gracefully."

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:43.380
Huh?

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:47.680
What's the holdup?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:50.510
You disappoint me, Ash Blake!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:53.100
Trying to sneak into the ladies' room.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:57.140
Is that any way for an Ansullivan student to act?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.880
Wrong! You are <i>so</i> wrong!

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.900
Eco went in there, and she never came out!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.070
Eco? Your Pal?

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.170
This was in there too.

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:13.780
What is it?

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:16.040
Fafnirite dust.

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:19.960
Someone must have used this to abduct your Pal.

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:22.960
So what I thought I saw earlier...

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.210
Calm down!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:32.520
You don't mean to run around
randomly looking for her, do you?

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.430
Did you have a better idea?!

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.180
Have you learned <i>anything</i> at the Academy?

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.440
Huh?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.190
You and Eco are joined by
the astral flow, aren't you?

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:53.080
Is that your starbrand?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.270
Pretty much.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.850
So what should I do?

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.960
First, focus your consciousness on your starbrand.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:02.110
Then think about Eco, as strongly as you can.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.930
All right. I'll give it a shot.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.140
<i>Eco, where are you?</i>

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.190
<i>Please...</i>

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:24.740
<i>Tell me where Eco is!</i>

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:31.800
What are these?

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.180
So you can see them.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:38.000
They're only visible to pairs
bound by the astral flow.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:42.250
Follow them. They should lead you to Eco.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.500
Hang in there, Eco!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:57.510
In here!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.630
Damn, it's locked!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.150
Fafnirite?

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.340
Okay. Let's go!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.160
D-Don't just leave me here!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.150
Wh-What is all this?

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:25.820
Don't bother.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:36.880
You think you can get away with whatever you're doing to me?

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.310
Aren't <i>you</i> a lively one?!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.550
Not that I'm complaining.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:44.190
For a dragon to be born
looking like a human is...

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:46.690
quite unexpected.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.400
You mean you know about me?!

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:54.610
That's right. I've brought you here as my research subject.

00:16:55.690 --> 00:17:00.280
For what purpose would a dragon assume human form?

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:01.750
<i>You</i> tell <i>me</i> !

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.640
You mean you don't know?

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:08.620
But don't you all share the Draguarth, the memories passed down through generations of dragonkind?

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.380
I tried looking myself up in it,
but access was denied.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.990
The Draguarth, access denied?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.800
One mystery leads to another.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.510
Now I'm really curious.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:22.710
If even you have no idea,

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:26.520
I'll have to ask your body directly.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:30.020
Dissection is the foundation of biology, after all.

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.280
Eco!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:39.780
Dammit!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.030
Stand back!

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:44.040
Crimson Express!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:49.940
Eco!

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:52.750
Get over here and rescue me!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.170
What a rude bunch.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.040
What are you doing to my Pal?

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:00.180
I'm just responding to the Academy's request,

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.180
albeit in a slightly pushy way.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:06.040
What request?

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.100
You mean you're...

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:10.090
Doctor Angela Cornwell.

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.480
Doctor Cornwell? So...

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.290
The Academy has asked Dr. Cornwell to conduct an investigation

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:19.990
in order to determine
the best way to deal with her.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:24.620
So <i>she</i> is the foremost authority
on dragon research?

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.760
I wasn't up for it at first.

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:31.920
But when I heard about a dragon born in human form, well...

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:36.940
From the moment I laid eyes on this one,
I wanted to dissect her.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:40.430
They don't let you go quite that far at the Academy, do they?

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.930
So you're the one I sensed hanging around.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:47.480
Whatever your reasons,
you've committed a kidnapping.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.440
Now give me back my Pal!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:54.930
I'm not going to give up such
an intriguing sample that easily.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.440
Fafnirite!

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:02.700
Doctor, what have you done?!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:07.530
This mansion is protected by an Oracle field.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.370
Those stone markers?

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.460
Exactly right.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:16.660
Call out to your Pals as much as you want,
but you won't be able to summon them.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:21.480
I need you to be quiet
until I'm done dissecting her.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.100
Dark Mother's Lullaby.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:31.070
A magic circle?

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:31.930
Your Highness!

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.970
Your Highness... Cosette...

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.360
Sweet dreams.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:40.560
By the time you open your eyes,
it will all be over.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:44.370
G-Give Eco back!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.720
Ash!

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.430
Stubborn boy.

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.740
Don't worry.

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:58.800
I have no intention of taking your life.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:05.100
<i>After all, I don't want to be a
taboo-breaking dragonslayer...</i>

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.310
<i>like Prince Julius.</i>

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:08.660
As if...

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:10.440
I'd just...

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.310
sleep...

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:16.140
You've come all this way, and for what?!

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:18.710
If you fall asleep, I swear I'll never forgive you!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:23.150
You'd better listen...

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.450
Listen to your master!

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.330
What is this?

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.000
It can't be!

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:44.030
Has her magic poured into you through the astral flow?

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:46.510
Spare me the particulars!

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:53.380
Impossible...

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.270
I won't let you get in my way.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.270
I'm taking back my Pal!

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:01.520
It's all so...

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:04.280
fascinating!

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:09.030
A-About time!

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:20.200
Look here.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:26.050
Is that any place for you
to be touching your master?

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:41.290
Pretty full day, huh?

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:45.820
Eco...

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:50.920
So you're my Pal.

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:03.180
Hey, Ash!

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:05.220
I heard all about the craziness that went down yesterday!

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:09.720
Got a royal right hook in front of the whole town, huh?

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:13.020
It's all over the Academy!

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:15.980
Oh, so no one's talking about the doctor?

00:22:16.470 --> 00:22:17.470
Doctor?

00:22:17.470 --> 00:22:19.210
Uh, nothing.

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:22.120
I never want to have anything
to do with her again.

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:31.990
I'll be your new homeroom teacher.

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:34.410
Angela Cornwell.

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:37.660
Wow! Shot through the heart!

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:39.940
You must be joking.

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:42.670
When will she ever learn?

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:47.640
You may call me Professor Angela.

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:49.510
Let's make this a great year!

00:24:22.290 --> 00:24:23.310
You mongrel!

00:24:23.310 --> 00:24:24.060
Underling!

00:24:24.060 --> 00:24:25.310
Good-for-nothing!

00:24:25.310 --> 00:24:26.650
What's your deal, Ash?

00:24:26.650 --> 00:24:28.690
I feel these waves of pleasure with every word you say!

00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:29.980
Hey! You're not-

00:24:29.980 --> 00:24:34.490
No, no! I'm just reading what I'm supposed to say, see? Really!

00:24:34.490 --> 00:24:35.590
Aren't I?
